      "description": "Daily source sweep: re-plan the hub.go.kr list and the VWorld datasets the endpoint catalog marks source_sweep, skip files already held, land every new one in Bronze; a stopped run resumes (root ADR-0077, ADR-0168, ADR-0172).",
